<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-WAIKATO BEAT WELLINGTON 23-18.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WAIKATO BEAT WELLINGTON 23-18.</headline>
<dateline>PALMERSTON NORTH, New Zealand 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waikato</p>
<p>Chiefs beat Wellington Hurricanes 23-18 (halftime 11-8) in the</p>
<p>opening Super 12 rugby union match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Waikato Chiefs: Tries - Walter Little, Eric Rush, Glen</p>
<p>Osborne; conversion - Matthew Cooper; penalties - Cooper (2).</p>
<p>Wellington Hurricanes: Tries - Jarrod Cunningham, Tana</p>
<p>Umaga; conversion - Jon Preston; penalties - Preston (2).</p>
</text>
